    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Halligan O`Connor Property Consultants are delighted to present 17 Bremore Pastures Park, a bright and spacious two-bedroom ground-floor apartment situated within this popular and well-established residential development in Balbriggan. \n\nExtending to c. 61 sqm, this attractive home benefits from its own private entrance and a generous private rear garden/patio, offering a rare combination of apartment living and excellent outdoor space. \n\nInternally, the accommodation is well laid out and centres around a spacious open-plan kitchen and living area. The kitchen provides excellent space for everyday cooking and entertaining, while the two well-proportioned bedrooms offer flexibility for couples, young families, guests or those requiring a home office. \n\nThe property also benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and a BER C rating, helping to provide comfortable and efficient year-round living. \n\nParking bays are conveniently positioned beside the apartment block, while a large green area to the front enhances the open feel of the development. \n\nBremore Pastures enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of Balbriggan`s many amenities. The beach, Balbriggan Train Station and local schools are all within walking distance, while Castlemill and Millfield Shopping Centres provide a wide range of shops and services nearby. The M1 Motorway is easily accessible, with Dublin Airport also just a short drive away.\n\n\nBalbriggan benefits from excellent public transport connections, with bus and rail services within walking distance, providing convenient commuting options to Dublin city. The nearby motorway network also allows straightforward access to Dublin Airport, the city centre and destinations throughout the wider region.\n\nThe coastal town continues to benefit from significant regeneration and investment through the `Our Balbriggan` project, with an estimated 57 million being invested in improvements to the town centre, harbour and surrounding public spaces.\n\nBalbriggan also boasts a distinctive cultural and recreational offering, including the nearby Irish Institute of Music & Song, while beautiful coastal surroundings and an excellent selection of local primary and secondary schools add to the area`s appeal. Ardgillan Castle & Demesne is just a short drive away, providing extensive parkland, walking routes and picturesque surroundings overlooking the Irish Sea.\n\nContact Halligan O`Connor, Balbriggan Estate Agents, to arrange a private viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\n\nOpen Plan Sittingroom/dining/kitchen\n\nBathroom\n\nPrimary Bedroom\n\nBedroom 2\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
